Z||000000||Smokey||12-17-1999||11:07 PM||||Ok, heres the deal...i have a 1985 2m4 and i was cruising down the road today when I felt the need for speed...dont know what i was thinkin when i only got the 2.5 but hey, im just weird :-) anyway as soon as i got on it and it dropped a gear i heard this really loud whining noise. i was only about a mile away from my house, so i figured id keep going incase it died if i pulled over. when i got to my house i popped my trunk and heard the noise comming from my alternator, yay! bearings are shot! guess when i got on it she was on her last leg and it was spinning just a little to fast :-) anyway, after i get it fixed im going to sell it to try and get my hands on a GT. besides a brake caliper when i first got it, this is the only other problem it's had, but the guy who had it before me bought the alternator thats in it now from a junk yard. the body is in perfect condition, has glossy paint,and a sunroof but i have one blown headlight motor, so i just cranked em up and left em there, everything in the interior is great except for the drivers seat, its ripped some right on the edge from people getting in and out of it. it runs great, has good tires, doesn't leak anything, and has just had a full tune-up. the guy before me payed 2,000 for it, he is 75 years old and was driving it around for a good while and his wife was in really shape, she couldnt get in and out of it anymore. So he went out and bought a little pick up that was easy for her and she died not much later, he never did anything else with the fiero. Just sat it in the back yard and threw a cover over it. He was trying to sell it for 1500 for a while but he didn't advertise it at all. Well i knew his grandson and he told me about it, when i went to look at it i didn't have 1500 dollars. But one night he got drunk and told me $600 and its yours!! tired of looking at the damn thing. I said hell yea and got it. But now i want more power, so what do you think?||||reg||1
